#: 44711c0b469741a3ac5dc25587b2142f
msgid "Purpose"
msgstr "用途"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:11
#: bbadf2f264104b48aeb516ad6ee1724d
msgid ""
"FaSim-Isaac is the one-click Isaac asset workspace: it pulls robot USD and "
"scene submodules, can install the Isaac ROS 2 Jazzy overlay, and starts Sim."
msgstr ""
"FaSim-Isaac 是一键 Isaac 资产工作空间：拉取机器人 USD 和场景子模块，可安装 Isaac ROS 2 Jazzy "
"overlay，并启动 Sim。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:13
#: 5852f74dd1bc4d269ba27b60fd581e40
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "前提条件"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:15
#: 58af611cec7e4ddca839ee110be63e63
msgid "NVIDIA Isaac Sim binary (GPU + matching drivers)"
msgstr "NVIDIA Isaac Sim 二进制（GPU 及匹配驱动）"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:16
#: 7713f42d355842e98e37c681209cbb84
msgid ""
"Default path `ISAACSIM_DIR` (`~/isaacsim`); override in "
"`config/fa_sim.local.conf` or the environment"
msgstr ""
"默认路径 `ISAACSIM_DIR`（`~/isaacsim`）；在 `config/fa_sim.local.conf` 或环境变量中覆盖"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:18
#: 94199bc3490d4b74ae4d5ceb75184def
msgid ""
"Do not hardcode a single Isaac minor version. `./init.sh` operation 2 "
"queries GitHub stable tags; fallback list in `config/fa_sim.conf` currently "
"`6.0.1` / `6.0.0` / `5.1.0`."
msgstr ""
"不要写死某一个 Isaac 次版本号。`./init.sh` 操作 2 会查询 GitHub 稳定 tag；回退列表见 "
"`config/fa_sim.conf`，目前是 `6.0.1` / `6.0.0` / `5.1.0`。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:20
#: a4822313580f40bfa4f67fdb83bedf78
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "安装"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:22
#: 57e1bee9273f45888511be839aae8cf5
msgid ""
"git clone git@github.com:fiveages-sim/FaSim-Isaac.git\n"
"cd FaSim-Isaac\n"
"./init.sh\n"
"./run.sh"
msgstr ""
"git clone git@github.com:fiveages-sim/FaSim-Isaac.git\n"
"cd FaSim-Isaac\n"
"./init.sh\n"
"./run.sh"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:29
#: 24419f89a6cb4631a58a9b0ca319f0a4
msgid "What `./init.sh` does:"
msgstr "`./init.sh` 做什么："

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:31
#: 08ed40a562f74f1bbaad20f73151fad1
msgid ""
"Initialize selected submodules (`.gitmodules` / "
"`submodules_visibility.conf`; public default)"
msgstr "初始化勾选的子模块（`.gitmodules` / `submodules_visibility.conf`；默认 public）"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:32
#: b310e33f124d4f8183cfca850bda888e
msgid ""
"Optional Isaac ROS 2 Jazzy workspace (`isaac_jazzy_ws/`). Override version "
"with `ISAAC_SIM_VERSION=… ./init.sh`"
msgstr ""
"可选 Isaac ROS 2 Jazzy 工作空间（`isaac_jazzy_ws/`）。用 `ISAAC_SIM_VERSION=… "
"./init.sh` 覆盖版本"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:34
#: 19a8648c01b34db2b0c9f1fa02132940
msgid ""
"What `./run.sh` does: optional CPU governor, optional Zenoh router, then a "
"menu — **PhysX** / **Newton** / **Headless Streaming**. There is no "
"`./run.sh --robot`, `--headless`, or `--env`."
msgstr ""
"`./run.sh` 做什么：可选 CPU 调频、可选 Zenoh router，然后是菜单 — **PhysX** / **Newton** / "
"**Headless Streaming**。没有 `./run.sh --robot`、`--headless` 或 `--env`。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:36
#: e86ee1abfbea4905a5ff4b0b306c2e07
